        <activity xml:id="var-wc-feetq" label="var-wc-feetq">
          <statement>
            <p>Write a program that will convert a user entered number of inches to feet. 
                            Reminder: there are 12 inches in a foot.</p>
          </statement>
          <program interactive="activecode" language="python">
            <code>

        </code>
          </program>
          <solution>
              <p>Write a program that will convert a user entered number of inches to feet.  Reminder: there are 12 inches in a foot.</p>
    <program interactive="activecode"  language="python" label="var-wc-feetq-sol"><code>

#prompt the user for the amount of inches they would like to convert
inches = input("How many inches would you like to convert?")

#convert the inches to an integer
inches_int = int(inches)

#convert to feet
feet = inches_int / 12

#print the amount of feet
print(feet)
        </code></program>
        </solution>
        </activity>

